<li>invalid token -&gt; 401</li>
<li>valid read token -&gt; cannot purchase</li>
<li>valid writer without grant -&gt; cannot purchase</li>
<li>caller actor=3D=E2=80=9Cowner=E2=80=9D has no effect</li>
<li>empty actor cannot become admin</li>
<li>cross-tenant resource -&gt; denied</li>
</ul>
<p>PHASE 3 =E2=80=94 REAL QP PERSISTENCE</p>
<p>Move QP migration into configured <code>migrations/</code> path, version=
 after 0003.</p>
<p>Create <code>qp/store.ts</code> or <code>src/qp-store.ts</code> with a n=
arrow interface:</p>

<code>putContract(spec)
getContract(root)
