<li>receipt hash unique</li>
<li>effect idempotency key unique</li>
<li>event seq/hash unique</li>
<li>foreign keys from receipt -&gt; contract/claim/grant</li>
<li>no receipt overwrite</li>
<li>no evidence overwrite under same id with different bytes</li>
</ul>
<p>PHASE 4 =E2=80=94 CANONICAL CRYPTO PRIMITIVES</p>
<p>Create one module <code>qp/crypto.ts</code>:</p>

<code>canonicalJson(value)
sha256Bytes/string(value)
