<p>PHASE 5 =E2=80=94 TRUSTED PROGRAM REGISTRY</p>
<p>Create build-time program manifest:</p>

<code>program-manifest.json
</code>
<p>For each judge/gate/transition/probe/adapter:</p>
<ul>
