<li>build ownership evidence.</li>
<li>run <code>domain_owned</code> ProofSpec judge/gates.</li>
<li>settle signed receipt TRUE/FALSE/UNKNOWN.</li>
<li>if provider call may have succeeded but readback fails -&gt; UNKNOWN_RE=
CONCILE, never blindly retry purchase.</li>
<li>reconciliation job reads account state and settles later.</li>
